<title>ROMANIA: TABLE-Romania producer prices 5.8 pct up in May.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Romania producer prices 5.8 pct up in May.</headline>
<dateline>BUCHAREST 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Producer prices in Romanian</p>
<p>industry rose by 5.8 percent in May after a 5.2 percent growth</p>
<p>in April, National Statistics Board (CNS) data showed.</p>
<p>Producer prices were 195.4 percent up year-on-year in May.</p>
<p> ROMANIAN PRODUCER PRICES	MAY 97  APRIL 97     MAY 96</p>
<p> mth/mth change		    +5.8	 +5.2	+3.7</p>
<p>  extraction industry	   +15.3	 +2.2	+0.2</p>
<p>  processing industry	    +3.7	 +6.3	+4.4</p>
<p>  energy and gas industry	+9.2	 +1.9	+0.0</p>
<p>-- Bucharest Newsroom 40-1 3120264</p>
</text>
